It is Saturday.
I go into the large shop.
It is warm in here.
I take off my thin jacket.
I put the jacket into my shopping bag.
I am looking for a warm winter coat.
I find a thick, dark green coat.
It has the size thirty-eight.
I look at the price tag.
The coat costs one hundred and twenty euros.
I put the new coat on right here.
It is long and very warm.
The dark coat is perfect, because it is really thick.
I want to buy the coat.
I take the green coat off again.
I carry the coat over my arm.
